{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00047","headline":"赋得夏首啓节 · 太宗皇帝","name":"赋得夏首啓节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北阙三春晚，南荣九夏初。\n黄莺弄渐变，翠林花落余。\n瀑流还响谷，猿啼自应虚。\n早荷向心卷，长杨就影舒。\n此时欢不极，调轸坐相於。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}